<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>SUICIDE FERRIS WHEEL</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Løvesick</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">CHRIS RAIN</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">SUICIDE FERRIS WHEEL</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">5jj59rLl7K5UOWnDz8x0A3</ttm:item>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:06.890" end="00:10.080" ttm:agent="v1">Won't be falling for you</p>
      <p begin="00:10.080" end="00:12.980" ttm:agent="v1">Hmm, hmhm</p>
      <p begin="00:12.980" end="00:17.290" ttm:agent="v1">Won't be falling for you</p>
      <p begin="00:17.290" end="00:19.400" ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm on it again</p>
      <p begin="00:19.400" end="00:23.230" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck the mix I just want rum in my head oh</p>
      <p begin="00:23.230" end="00:25.570" ttm:agent="v1">You think I'm wanting you bad?</p>
      <p begin="00:25.570" end="00:28.460" ttm:agent="v1">Have you even seen the state that I'm at?</p>
      <p begin="00:28.460" end="00:31.770" ttm:agent="v1">I've got no room for you</p>
      <p begin="00:31.770" end="00:34.010" ttm:agent="v1">Got bills and my rent is due</p>
      <p begin="00:34.010" end="00:37.850" ttm:agent="v1">So why, are you coming through?</p>
      <p begin="00:37.850" end="00:41.630" ttm:agent="v1">Got no money, got no room for you</p>
      <p begin="00:41.630" end="00:43.770" ttm:agent="v1">So why we do it again?</p>
      <p begin="00:43.770" end="00:46.620" ttm:agent="v1">All my flowers ended up in the bin</p>
      <p begin="00:46.620" end="00:49.550" ttm:agent="v1">Late night problems don't solve with a ring</p>
      <p begin="00:49.550" end="00:52.490" ttm:agent="v1">No I won't be falling for you</p>
      <p begin="00:52.490" end="00:54.030" ttm:agent="v1">Cause girl you're bad</p>
      <p begin="00:54.030" end="00:55.700" ttm:agent="v1">Girl you're bad inside</p>
      <p begin="00:55.700" end="00:58.560" ttm:agent="v1">Got me out here tempting if I'd suicide</p>
      <p begin="00:58.560" end="01:02.260" ttm:agent="v1">So get me off, of your ferris wheel cause</p>
      <p begin="01:02.260" end="01:08.220" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna ride if your love ain't real oh</p>
      <p begin="01:08.220" end="01:14.380" ttm:agent="v1">Won't be falling for you</p>
      <p begin="01:14.380" end="01:18.170" ttm:agent="v1">I won't be falling for you</p>
      <p begin="01:18.170" end="01:20.590" ttm:agent="v1">And how many times</p>
      <p begin="01:20.590" end="01:24.620" ttm:agent="v1">I took all these pictures and thought if this is me?</p>
      <p begin="01:24.620" end="01:26.700" ttm:agent="v1">Is it a lie?</p>
      <p begin="01:26.700" end="01:30.530" ttm:agent="v1">Cause I don't think I wanna spin on your death wheel</p>
      <p begin="01:30.530" end="01:32.590" ttm:agent="v1">I walk in the dark</p>
      <p begin="01:32.590" end="01:36.570" ttm:agent="v1">I've been walking and feeling my scars</p>
      <p begin="01:36.570" end="01:38.820" ttm:agent="v1">So where is the sun?</p>
      <p begin="01:38.820" end="01:42.730" ttm:agent="v1">We're called by a light from afar</p>
      <p begin="01:42.730" end="01:46.050" ttm:agent="v1">To live or die I can't decide</p>
      <p begin="01:46.050" end="01:49.000" ttm:agent="v1">I kiss the sky man what a life</p>
      <p begin="01:49.000" end="01:51.620" ttm:agent="v1">I can't pretend that I don't miss you</p>
      <p begin="01:51.620" end="01:55.140" ttm:agent="v1">But I'm afraid I need to let you just go</p>
      <p begin="01:55.140" end="01:57.300" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa</p>
      <p begin="01:57.300" end="02:01.440" ttm:agent="v1">I need you, I need you, I need you to let go</p>
      <p begin="02:01.440" end="02:03.720" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa</p>
      <p begin="02:03.720" end="02:07.380" ttm:agent="v1">Thinking 'bout suicide in my room tonight</p>
      <p begin="02:07.380" end="02:10.510" ttm:agent="v1">Suicide, pick up the knife</p>
      <p begin="02:10.510" end="02:13.730" ttm:agent="v1">And cut out the loose ends that I might find</p>
      <p begin="02:13.730" end="02:16.720" ttm:agent="v1">Ring on her finger but where is the bride?</p>
      <p begin="02:16.720" end="02:22.930" ttm:agent="v1">She's out there vowing to some other guy oh</p>
      <p begin="02:22.930" end="02:29.120" ttm:agent="v1">And I thought I'd heal if she'd kiss me goodbye</p>
      <p begin="02:29.120" end="02:32.650" ttm:agent="v1">But look where you got me I barely survived</p>
      <p begin="02:32.650" end="02:34.680" ttm:agent="v1">So why we do it again?</p>
      <p begin="02:34.680" end="02:37.600" ttm:agent="v1">All my flowers ended up in the bin</p>
      <p begin="02:37.600" end="02:40.580" ttm:agent="v1">Late night problems don't solve with a ring</p>
      <p begin="02:40.580" end="02:43.580" ttm:agent="v1">No I won't be falling for you</p>
      <p begin="02:43.580" end="02:45.160" ttm:agent="v1">Cause girl you're bad</p>
      <p begin="02:45.160" end="02:46.660" ttm:agent="v1">Girl you're bad inside</p>
      <p begin="02:46.640" end="02:49.700" ttm:agent="v1">Got me out here tempting if I'd suicide</p>
      <p begin="02:49.700" end="02:53.250" ttm:agent="v1">So get me off, of your ferris wheel cause</p>
      <p begin="02:53.250" end="02:56.510" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna ride if your love ain't real oh</p>
      <p begin="02:56.510" end="03:00.510" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
